      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.christchurch1735.org/about"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Weems‑Bots House, restored in the 1970s, now operates as a museum and research library of local history.",
